OL,3,APolice forces failing investigation
OL,4,Abasics, says inspectorate report
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany police forces in England and Wales
OL,7,Fstill need to make improvements in the
OL,8,Fway they investigate crime and other
OL,9,F"basics" of policing, according to His
OL,10,FMajesty's Chief Inspector of
OL,11,FConstabulary (HMIC).
OL,13,FIn her annual report, Michelle Skeer
OL,14,Falso said too many victims were not
OL,15,Freceiving the quality of service they
OL,16,Fshould expect.
OL,18,FForces continue to struggle when it
OL,19,Fcomes to gathering evidence,
OL,20,Fidentifying and progressing lines of
OL,21,Finquiry, and keeping victims updated on
OL,22,Ftheir cases, she added.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
