OL,3,APolice forces failing investigation
OL,4,Abasics, says inspectorate report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was progress in neighbourhood
OL,7,Fpolicing and in some of the work
OL,8,Fcarried out by regional organised crime
OL,9,Funits that focus on offenders across
OL,10,Fmultiple local police force boundaries,
OL,11,Fthe report said.
